# The carrier and the woodcutter walk as whole figures: the first loop of play/first-loop.play, then shots while they
# walk, zoomed in and out, and with the view panned once around the map so the settlers show on its wrapped copy.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --play play/settler-bodies.play
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 21 4
wait 0.3
button Flag
click-tile 27 5
button Flag
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 22 5
click-tile 23 5
click-tile 24 5
click-tile 25 5
click-tile 26 5
click-tile 27 5
button Road
wait 0.3
button Woodcutter
click-tile 26 4
button Woodcutter
wait 0.3

# The carrier walks to its road and the woodcutter out to a tree.
wait 6
shot walk-1
wait 1.5
shot walk-2
scroll up 3 450 300
wait 0.3
dump zoomed-in
shot zoomed-in
wait 2
shot zoomed-in-2
scroll down 5 450 300
wait 0.3
dump zoomed-out
shot zoomed-out

# 32 columns away the settlers come round again on the map's wrapped copy.
scroll up 2 450 300
wait 0.3
hold Right 3
wait 0.3
dump wrapped
shot wrapped
hold Right 3
wait 0.3
dump wrapped-2
shot wrapped-2
expect ticks > 10
